# league.json carries one operator's real league identity (name,
# divisions, draft date, invite copy) — never the public tree's business.
# Ship config/league.json.example (neutral) instead; an operator's own
# league.json belongs at the repo root, config/league.json, or beside
# DATA_FILE (see LEAGUE_FILE lookup order, internal/league/config.go).
/league.json
/config/league.json
# Operator manifests, targets, and league identity are private.
